        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>5.4.3　对照只替换这一个段落</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>摘要证明身份，差异解释含义</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', width: 1152 }}>作者应保留两份最终全文、精确文本差异和内容摘要，三样各有各的用处。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 150, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>内容摘要</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>帮助确认材料身份，说明手里这一份到底是哪一版。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 150, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>精确文本差异</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>正文差异才解释实验含义，读者要看到真正改变的那几行。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 100, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>哈希不同不能单独证明「只差澄清策略」</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两个包哈希不同只说明它们不是同一个文件；要支持唯一变量的说法，还要核对其余装配项。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
